的健康安心感😌麵條不算硬吃起來一般，湯頭香醇濃郁醬油味不油膩，溏心蛋是流心狀態非常棒，不到兩百的價格卻帶來近乎三百的滿足感，CP值超高，老闆開店看似隨性但也看得出用心經營且下過苦功，附近不算好停車，加上開店時間較特別，因此是家不太容易吃到的拉麵店，能吃到的人算是有福了，好店家值得推廣，下次有機會再來試試熱銷的雞鹽清湯！",null,[0,61]]]],[null,1706010766000000,1706010766000000,"2 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04MHVFSUo3MjVscjZpT0FBMjdiZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQm04MHVFSUo3MjVscjZpT0FBMjdiZxoTQ2d3SWp0Ry1yUVlReWJ1UXJRTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj_tu6ZxtKWAxUKdvUHHY0RDU8Q_2MIlwIoDg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4126853881898507599/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk9hRnBZYlMxQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4126853881898507599/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk9hRnBZYlMxQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4126853881898507599/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk9hRnBZYlMxQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4126853881898507599/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk9hRnBZYlMxQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4126853881898507599/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk9hRnBZYlMxQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4126853881898507599/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTk9hRnBZYlMxQlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝評價 撐得住會再見面的",null,[0,13]]]],[null,null,7895,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOaFpYbS1BRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7d190119f2f203dc!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICNhZXm-AE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOaFpYbS1BRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOaFpYbS1BRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOaFpYbUJBEhNDZ3dJM0oyWXJRWVFnSURFa0FFGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ05oWlhtaEFFEhNDZ3dJM0oyWXJRWVFn